ic Universe, featuring interviews and behind-the-scenes footage from all of the Marvel films, the Marvel One-Shots and \\\"Marvel's Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.\\\"!\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":593691,\"title\":\"HOMECOMING: A film by Beyoncé\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nKdP4K3Bj3qnjtDCq9lTg7UOHVy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rfqUYH6gav0P2uwvSSwjahAwzwk.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This intimate, in-depth look at Beyoncé's celebrated 2018 Coachella performance reveals the emotional road from creative concept to cultural movement.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446663,\"title\":\"Andre the Giant\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n4t2g7NbHGu0c51jlQ2qlOZEhvr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vrdC1pbm8ScJIPaUguvFWXCtMdo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An ambitious and wide-ranging documentary exploring Andre’s upbringing in France, his celebrated career in WWE, and his forays in the entertainment world.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":301959,\"title\":\"Interstellar: Nolan's Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i4PpBcuLvdcJwIf3hkcV9QDR1iH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look behind the lens of Christopher Nolan's space epic.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":339927,\"title\":\"Kevin Hart: What Now?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lFg4tx0jAYkgrcm1bPBlM0FbQvH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d4pIsjOiPz8CUhkBCXFJVxSwNDY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Comedian Kevin Hart performs in front of a crowd of 50,000 people at Philadelphia's outdoor venue, Lincoln Financial Field.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76360,\"title\":\"6 Days to Air: The Making of South Park\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/itnA0QZio9kzgI3jy1dTwQfutCg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yjljxu4lobzhz5pMvppay8Q30Xj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Viewers will get a look at Parker and Stone's thought process as they approach a new episode and the 24/7 grind they subject themselves to each time the show is in production. The documentary also includes in-depth interviews with Parker and Stone about their working partnership and reflections on highlights from their careers.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":377319,\"title\":\"Derren Brown: Pushed to the Edge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hL31qRjjhVynNnBCkTLGKbbA956.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j1DvSauyBo2sgUogb0plTfZmzYo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Derren Brown investigates the power of social compliance by persuading an unwitting member of the public into believing that they have pushed someone to their death.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":367735,\"title\":\"John Mulaney: The Comeback Kid\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pzM9t33T2YUA7vaCb2GxaDrlTW1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8iTGzNjDAFsn2zZr6sdJ79GLp5K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Armed with boyish charm and a sharp wit, the former \\\"SNL\\\" writer offers sly takes on marriage, his beef with babies and the time he met Bill Clinton.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":613999,\"title\":\"Aziz Ansari: Right Now\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5vaYOkQ3MxOnxQLeKUNXiAfZVHb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QyZSGSGIGqeODxBc2ssltu4ldj